  [0,0,0,0.125,0.1875,0.25,0.3125,0.3671875,0.417969,0.464844,0.5078125,0.547363,0.58374,0.6171875,0.647949,0.676239,0.702255,0.726181,0.748184,0.768419,0.787028,0.804142]

  PDF:
